@startuml
' Alternative 3: flow-oriented pattern interaction view.

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

rectangle "User / BrowserUI" as User #FFFFFF
rectangle "SeparationService\n<<Facade>>" as Facade #DCEBFF
rectangle "ModelService\nactive or selected model" as Model #E4F7E7
rectangle "SeparationAlgorithmFactory\n<<Creator>>" as Factory #E4F7E7
rectangle "SeparationAlgorithm\n<<Strategy>>" as Strategy #FFF1CC
rectangle "NeoSSNetStrategy\n<<ConcreteStrategy>>" as NeoSSNet #FFF1CC
rectangle "Heart + Lung WAV Outputs" as Outputs #F6F7F9

User --> Facade : POST separate
Facade --> Model : choose model
Model --> Factory : model architecture
Facade --> Factory : create(model)
Factory --> Strategy : returns algorithm
Factory --> NeoSSNet : creates current strategy
NeoSSNet ..> Strategy : implements
Facade --> Strategy : separate()
Strategy --> Outputs : saves outputs

@enduml
